[TITLE.]
8. Dera, laza, hery, haja

1.
Dera, laza, hery, haja
Ho an'Andriamanitra
Tompon'aina, Zanahary,
Rain'ny voninahitra,

Izy no mpanao antsika
Sady ivelomana;
Fototr'aina, foto-tsoa,
Izy ivavahana.

[FIV.]

[FIV.]
Hihira isika hoe: Haleloia!
Dera ho an'Andriamanitra
:,:Dia Haleloia!
Haleloia:,:

2.
Ray tsy toha, tsy miova,
Tia sy mamindra fo,
Mahasoa isan'andro,
Izy no isaorana;

Vatolampy tsy mifindra,
Tokin'olombelona;
Fiarova-mahavonjy,
Izy itokiana :

[FIV.]